## Command

```shell
biome lint '<TEMP_DIR>/plugin_includes_are_relative_to_configuration_directory'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "plugins": [
    {
      "path": "./no-assign.grit",
      "includes": ["packages/**/src/**", "!packages/**/src/generated/**"]
    }
  ]
}
```

## `no-assign.grit`

```grit
`Object.assign($args)` where {
    register_diagnostic(span = $args, message = "Prefer object spread")
}
```

## `packages/example/scripts/index.js`

```js
Object.assign({}, value);

```

## `packages/example/src/generated/index.js`

```js
Object.assign({}, value);

```

## `packages/example/src/index.js`

```js
Object.assign({}, value);

```

